CHECK:COMPARISON_TO_NULL: Comparison to NULL could be written "!swap_p"
#63: FILE: kernel/sched/core.c:4874:
+	if (swap_p == NULL)

Comparisons to NULL in the form (foo == NULL) or (foo != NULL)
are better written as (!foo) and (foo).

